libtranslit
------------------------------------------
Transliteration library with multiple backends

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  girepository-GLib2.0-1.86.0-2
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libicu76-76.1-2
  libm17n0-1.7.0-1
  libtranslit-devel-0.0.3-1bl9
  libtranslit0-0.0.3-1bl9
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gobject-introspection-1.86.0-2
  gtk-doc-1.37.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  libm17n-devel-1.7.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  vala-0.56.18-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ueno/libtranslit

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ueno/libtranslit/archive/refs/tags/0.0.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libtranslit-0.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libtranslit-0.0.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libtranslit-0.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtranslit-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtranslit0-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtranslit-devel-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtranslit-icu-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtranslit-m17n-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/girepository-Translit1.0-0.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/vala-libtranslit-0.0.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libtranslit)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libtranslit.README
  /usr/share/doc/libtranslit/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libtranslit/README

(libtranslit0)
  /usr/bin/cygtranslit-0.dll

(libtranslit-devel)
  /usr/include/translit-1.0/libtranslit/translit.h
  /usr/include/translit-1.0/libtranslit/translittransliterator.h
  /usr/lib/libtranslit.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libtranslit.pc

(libtranslit-icu)
  /usr/lib/libtranslit/modules/transliticu.dll

(libtranslit-m17n)
  /usr/lib/libtranslit/modules/translitm17n.dll

(girepository-Translit1.0)
  /usr/lib/girepository-1.0/Translit-1.0.typelib
  /usr/share/gir-1.0/Translit-1.0.gir

(vala-libtranslit)
  /usr/share/vala/vapi/libtranslit.deps
  /usr/share/vala/vapi/libtranslit.vapi

